hifiberry-bluetooth (1.0.6) stable; urgency=medium

  * Ship the ACR player definition as /etc/audiocontrol/players.d/bluetooth.json.
    The definition used to live in audiocontrol.json, which meant the package
    that provides bluetooth and the file that defines the player were owned by
    different packages.

